%% «planned» = Register v1.4, not in code (class planned, grey dashed) · (not written by code) = CHECK value never written (class notwritten, orange dashed).
%% Labels are short (trigger [guard] / effect); the full label of each transition is in the %% line under it.
%% Design decisions of 05/11/2026 applied here were confirmed by the lead.
stateDiagram-v2
  state orderType <<choice>>
  [*] --> orderType : «planned» / record invoiced sale or final order · UC50, UC51
  %% «planned» / created by record invoiced sale (UC50) or record final order (UC51) (Operator) · UC50, UC51
  orderType --> PendingPayment : «planned» [InvoicedSale - LowGrade or ForfeitResale] · UC50
  %% «planned» [InvoicedSale: saleReason LowGrade or ForfeitResale] · UC50
  orderType --> PendingPayment : «planned» [FinalOrder, price ≥ floor price] · UC51
  %% «planned» [FinalOrder: sales window closed (SalesWindowDays), price per kg ≥ floor price, one per batch] · UC51
  PendingPayment --> Completed : «planned» payment webhook [amount = invoice] / paid_at · UC50, UC51
  %% «planned» buyer payment webhook (OrderPayment) [amount = invoice] / paid_at; RevenueLine InvoicedSale or FinalOrder · UC50, UC51
  Completed --> [*]
  note right of PendingPayment
    PendingPayment - «planned» entry / Invoice issued, crabs Sold, VietQR (OrderPayment)
    «planned» start → orderType - / created by record invoiced sale (UC50) or record final order (UC51) (Operator)
    «planned» precondition of start → orderType - batch Harvesting, crabs InStock from harvested boxes and not on another order, LowGrade = weak, watery or frozen crabs, ForfeitResale = crabs released by a forfeited order (Figure 4.17), a final order only for leftover crabs and only once per batch
    «planned» orderType → PendingPayment - [InvoicedSale - saleReason LowGrade or ForfeitResale]
    «planned» orderType → PendingPayment - [FinalOrder - sales window closed (SalesWindowDays), price per kg ≥ floor price, one per batch]
    «planned» PendingPayment → Completed - buyer payment webhook (OrderPayment) [amount = invoice] / paid_at, RevenueLine InvoicedSale or FinalOrder
    whole machine «planned» - no code on develop
    «planned» - no invoiced sale, Invoice or final order on develop. It reuses values of ck_sales_order_status and the payment purpose OrderPayment, order_type BulkPreOrder, InvoicedSale and FinalOrder and the column saleReason (LowGrade, ForfeitResale) need new CHECK values (code - Retail, PreOrder, Offtake).
  end note
  %% Created by record invoiced sale (UC50) or record final order (UC51) (Operator) only if: «planned» batch Harvesting; crabs InStock from harvested boxes and not on another order; LowGrade = weak, watery or frozen crabs; ForfeitResale = crabs released by a forfeited order (Figure 4.17); a final order only for leftover crabs and only once per batch (UC50, UC51).
  %% Whole machine «planned»: no invoiced sale, Invoice or final order on develop. It reuses values of ck_sales_order_status and the payment purpose OrderPayment; order_type BulkPreOrder, InvoicedSale and FinalOrder and the column saleReason (LowGrade, ForfeitResale) need new CHECK values (code: Retail, PreOrder, Offtake).
  %% Lifecycle as in Sequence 4.59 and 4.60: recording the sale issues the Invoice and marks the crabs Sold (Figure 4.23); the buyer pays into the batch account and the order becomes Completed, counted as RevenueLine InvoicedSale or FinalOrder. The final order is the only sale after the sales window and is never below the floor price published before funding (research invariant). The buyer and its resale channel are outside the system.
  %% Open point for Nhân and Thiện: the sequences define no cancel or expiry path, so an unpaid invoice stays PendingPayment (its VietQR request can expire, Figure 4.11) until it is settled by hand.
  classDef planned stroke-dasharray:5 5,stroke:#64748b,color:#64748b,fill:#f8fafc
  classDef notwritten stroke-dasharray:5 5,stroke:#9a3412,fill:#f1f5f9
  classDef terminal fill:#f1f5f9,stroke:#64748b
  class Completed terminal
